+## Self-hosting
+
+Fizzy can be deployed to a single server with Kamal. Everything -- the app, background jobs, SQLite, and file storage -- runs in one container, with TLS handled by the proxy. Edit `config/deploy.yml` with your hostname and mail server, add your secrets to `.kamal/secrets`, then run `bin/kamal setup`.
+
+See the [deployment guide](docs/deployment.md) for the full walkthrough.
+
